# Blue Ankh key (items.md Keys), world pickup. Same shape as the HUD icon
# assets/src/hud/key_blue.pix, scaled to 16x24: loop head in fb_blue (the key's
# fullbright colour, shaded on its far side by the ramp), blue ramp crossbar
# and stem lit from the top-left. Frame 0 of the 18-tic shimmer: an
# fb_white glint on the head moves from top-left (f0) down the left side (f1).
name key_blue_idle_d0_f0
size 16 24
= 1 blue_02
= 2 blue_04
= 3 blue_06
= 4 blue_08
= 5 blue_10
= 6 blue_11
= F fb_blue
= W fb_white
outline fb_blue blue_00
outline fb_white blue_00
grid
.....FFFFF.....
....WFFFFF5....
...FFF...F54...
...FF.....F4...
...FF.....F4...
...FF.....54...
....FF...F4....
....FF...54....
.....FF.F4.....
......FF4......
56666666666665.
45555555544432.
